12:[["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-700","children":"Body Mass Index (BMI) is the most widely used first-pass screen for whether a\nperson's weight is in a healthy range for their height. Doctors, insurers and\nfitness apps all quote it — yet most people have never seen the actual\ncalculation. It takes ten seconds."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-10 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900","children":"The formula"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-700","children":"BMI is weight in kilograms divided by height in metres, squared:"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-700","children":["$","code",null,{"className":"rounded bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm text-slate-800","children":"BMI = weight (kg) ÷ height² (m²)"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-700","children":"That's the entire formula. No age, no gender, no body-fat measurement — just\ntwo numbers."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-10 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900","children":"A worked example"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-700","children":["Take someone who weighs ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"70 kg"}]," and is ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"1.75 m"}]," tall:"]}],"\n",["$","ol",null,{"className":"mt-4 list-decimal space-y-2 pl-6 text-slate-700","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["Square the height: 1.75 × 1.75 = ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"3.0625"}]]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["Divide the weight by that: 70 ÷ 3.0625 = ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"22.9"}]]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-700","children":"A BMI of 22.9 lands squarely in the \"normal weight\" band."}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-700","children":["If your measurements are in other units, convert first: 1 kg ≈ 2.2046 lb and\n1 m ≈ 3.2808 ft. The ",["$","a",null,{"className":"font-medium text-indigo-600 underline decoration-indigo-300 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-indigo-800","href":"/tools/health/bmi-calculator","children":"BMI Calculator"}]," accepts\nmetric inputs and shows your category instantly."]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-10 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900","children":"The WHO categories"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-700","children":"The World Health Organization's adult classification is:"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-slate-700","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Underweight"}]," — below 18.5"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Normal weight"}]," — 18.5 to 24.9"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Overweight"}]," — 25.0 to 29.9"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Obesity"}]," — 30.0 and above"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-700","children":"These bands are population-level screening thresholds, not diagnostic\nverdicts. A BMI of 26 is a prompt to look closer — at waist measurement,\nactivity, blood work — not a label."}],"\n",["$","div",null,{"className":"my-8 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-5","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-amber-800","children":[["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5","key":"1gvzjb"}],["path",{"d":"M9 18h6","key":"x1upvd"}],["path",{"d":"M10 22h4","key":"ceow96"}]],"className":"lucide-lightbulb h-4 w-4"}],"South Asian cut-offs"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-amber-900/90","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-700","children":"Several health bodies use lower thresholds for South Asian populations\nbecause cardiometabolic risk rises at lower BMI: overweight from 23 and\nobesity from 25. If you are from Nepal, India or the region, mention this to\nyour doctor — a \"normal\" WHO number can still warrant attention."}]}]]}],"\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b"]
13:["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-10 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900","children":"What BMI gets right"}]
14:["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-slate-700","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"It is consistent."}]," Two numbers, one formula, no equipment — so trends\nover months and years are comparable."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"It correlates."}]," At a population level, higher BMI tracks with higher\nrates of type-2 diabetes, hypertension and cardiovascular disease."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"It is free."}]," No lab, no scan, no subscription — which is exactly why it\nbecame the global default screen."]}],"\n"]}]
15:["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-10 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900","children":"What BMI gets wrong"}]
16:["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-slate-700","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"It cannot see muscle."}]," A muscular 80 kg athlete at 1.75 m reads as\n\"overweight\" (BMI 26.1) despite low body fat. Weightlifters routinely\n\"fail\" the test."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"It ignores fat distribution."}]," Visceral fat around the waist carries more\nrisk than the same weight carried elsewhere; waist circumference adds\ninformation BMI cannot."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"It is not for everyone."}]," The adult bands do not apply to children\n(who use age-and-sex growth charts), pregnant women, or the very elderly,\nwhere weight loss can be the bigger risk."]}],"\n"]}]
17:["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-10 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900","children":"A healthy way to use it"}]
18:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-700","children":["Treat BMI the way a smoke alarm works: cheap, always on, and good at saying\n",["$","em",null,{"children":"look closer"}]," — not at telling you what's burning. A sensible routine is:"]}]
19:["$","ol",null,{"className":"mt-4 list-decimal space-y-2 pl-6 text-slate-700","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Check BMI once every few months, not daily."}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Track the trend, and pair it with waist measurement."}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"If the number drifts out of range — or sits \"normal\" while your waist\ngrows — talk to a professional about the full picture: diet, activity,\nsleep and blood markers."}],"\n"]}]
