1b:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-700","children":["BMI is two divisions away from a useful, free screening signal — and exactly\none step removed from a diagnosis. Calculate it, log the trend, and let a\nprofessional interpret the rest. When you are ready, the\n",["$","a",null,{"className":"font-medium text-indigo-600 underline decoration-indigo-300 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-indigo-800","href":"/tools/health/bmi-calculator","children":"BMI Calculator"}]," gives you the number, the WHO\ncategory and a healthy weight range for your height in a single click."]}]
